{"seq":2,"slug":"creative-practice-research","title":"创作实践研究","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research","introMarkdown":"# 创作实践研究 简介\n\n创作实践研究是当代艺术教育中最具活力的研究方向，将艺术创作从单纯的技能展示提升为知识生产的过程。这一领域强调\"做中知\"——通过创作行为本身来发现、验证和传播新的认知，实现实践与理论的双向滋养。\n\n本课程围绕工作室实践、跨学科创作、展览策展和创作评论四个核心环节展开，覆盖创作研究从发生到展示再到反思的完整链路。\n\n第一章**工作室实践**探讨工作室作为知识生产空间的独特属性，涵盖反思性实践中行动与思考的循环关系、材料实验作为探索未知的研究手段，以及将创作过程系统记录和整理的文档化方法。\n\n第二章**跨学科创作**关注艺术与其他知识领域的交叉融合，介绍艺术与科学协作的方法和案例、数字技术和新媒体在创作中的介入方式，以及社会实践艺术通过艺术行动介入社会议题的理念和实践。\n\n第三章**展览与策展**聚焦创作成果从工作室走向公共空间的呈现过程，讲解策展实践的概念发展和方法论、装置艺术在空间叙事中的研究价值，以及公共艺术项目在社区和城市空间中的规划与实施。\n\n第四章**创作评论与反思**培养对自身和他人创作进行深度评价的能力，涵盖同行评议的结构化方法和建设性反馈技巧、自我评估中批判性自省的框架，以及作品集作为研究成果载体的策划和发展策略。\n\n建议学习者在整个学习过程中保持活跃的创作状态，创作实践研究的核心特征是实践不可脱离理论、理论也必须回到实践，两者是同一研究过程的不同面向。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"studio-practice","title":"工作室实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/studio-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reflective-practice","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 反思性实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/studio-practice/reflective-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"material-experimentation","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 材料实验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/studio-practice/material-experimentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"process-documentation","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 过程文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/studio-practice/process-documentation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interdisciplinary","title":"跨学科创作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/interdisciplinary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"art-science-collaboration","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 艺术与科学的协作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/interdisciplinary/art-science-collaboration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-mediated-art","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 技术介导的艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/interdisciplinary/technology-mediated-art"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-practice-art","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 社会实践艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/interdisciplinary/social-practice-art"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"exhibition","title":"展览与策展","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/exhibition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curatorial-practice","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 策展实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/exhibition/curatorial-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"installation-art-research","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 装置艺术研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/exhibition/installation-art-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-art-projects","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 公共艺术项目","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/exhibition/public-art-projects"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"critique","title":"创作评论与反思","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/critique","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"peer-critique-methods","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 同行评议方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/critique/peer-critique-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-evaluation","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 自我评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/critique/self-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"portfolio-development","title":"研究生 创作实践研究 — 作品集发展","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/arts/creative-practice-research/critique/portfolio-development"}]}]}